# Node/Vite/Parcel/Webpack build trash
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.turbo/

# OS + Editor artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.log

# Python junk, just in case
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Don't track temporary archives
*.zip
*.tar
*.tgz
*.gz
*.7z

# If you temporarily build in place
/build/
.tmp/
temp/

# Ignore source maps
*.map

# Ignore backup/IDE settings
*.orig
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# Optional: allow only prebuilt binaries and statics
# (comment these out if you *do* want to track built dist folders)
# portfolio-site/
# v86-terminal/
# shared-assets/

# Allow this README
!README.md
